    <figcaption>Sign in top right, then Get started. Use the same Google account as your Maps listing.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <p>
    Fill in the forms slowly and copy your details straight from your documents. Then check your
    email and the dashboard every day until you are approved.
  </p>
  <p>
    If anything gets stuck, <strong>phone Google’s Local Services support.</strong> Do not email.
    Emails sit for weeks; a phone call usually sorts it the same day.
  </p>
  <p>When every line turns green, your ad is live and you have the badge:</p>
  <figure>
    <Picture
